Package: CalFluxTools
Type: Package
Title: Package for internal use at NCATS, used for parsing and analyzing calcium flux data
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Andrew Patt, John Braisted
Maintainer: Andrew Patt <andrew.patt@nih.gov>
Description: Parses, quality controls, visualizes and analyzes results from data generated on the calcium flux platform. Accommodates a variety of study designs. Data should be in the statALL format and normalized using the Screenworks software.
License: GPL-2
Encoding: UTF-8
